trickle (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The package now ships the modern neotrickle implementation under the
    classic command names.
  * The classic command-line interface, bare KB/s values, /etc/trickled.conf,
    and the classic wire protocol are not supported.  Existing scripts must
    be migrated; see /usr/share/doc/trickle/migration-classic.md.
  * The service unit is not enabled automatically.  Review the configuration
    and enable ntrickled.service explicitly.

 -- Marcel Ferrari <marcel.mfnc@gmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
